SUMMARY:Cinco de Mayo Celebration at grandview
DESCRIPTION:It’s time to celebrate with a little Cinco de Mayo fun! \nJoin us SATURDAY May 2nd from 12-5pm for LIVE latin music (1-4pm) slushy specials\, margarita cocktails\, and Latin eats (Halo’s Eatery Food truck will be on site from 12-4pm). \nThe 1st 25 tables will get a surprise gift! Bring your friends for an afternoon of fun! \nNo admission charge. First come first serve seating inside and outside. \nCan’t stay for the fun? You can take Wine slushies and food TO GO! Wine slushies will be on special and Margarita wine 20% off (no limit)!
URL:https://grandviewwines.com/vineyard-event/cinco-de-mayo-celebration-at-grandview/
LOCATION:Grandview Vineyard\, 1489 Grandview Rd\, Mount Joy\, PA\, 17552\, United States
CATEGORIES:Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://grandviewwines.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/cincodemayo.jpg
END:VEVENT
