SUMMARY:Mother's Day Ladies Night at grandview
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a Mother’s Day Ladies Night at Grandview full of fun activities to celebrate mothers & women! There’s something for everyone!\n\nHere’s what we have going on:\n\nYoga in the Vineyard with Twisted Fitness 6-7pm – sign up in advance \nClick Here to Purchase Yoga Tickets\n\nPlant Bar by Terrarium Therapy (no advanced sign up required\, however you can reserve your spot by clicking the ticket link)\nClick Here to Reserve Your Spot\n\nMore Vendors to Come!!\n\nInvite your friends and enjoy our ladies night from 5:30pm – 8:30pm!
URL:https://grandviewwines.com/vineyard-event/mothers-day-ladies-night-at-grandview-3/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://grandviewwines.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Copy-of-Mothers-Day-Ladies-Night-Promo.jpg
END:VEVENT
