SUMMARY:Celebrate Mom at grandview
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Moms with a “Mom”osa flight\, available on Friday May 8 and Saturday May 9 from 12-5pm. Please note that Mimosa flights will ONLY be available for those who make reservations and they will be served inside the tasting room. We will be accepting reservations beginning April 27th for indoor seating during daytime hours. Please call 717-653-4825 in order to make your reservation.\nFirst come first serve seating will also be available on the deck\, however we will not be serving flights on our deck. Full size “Mom”osas may be purchased for deck seating.\n\n[Please note that we will be CLOSED on Sunday\, May 10th]
URL:https://grandviewwines.com/vineyard-event/celebrate-mom-at-grandview-2/
LOCATION:Grandview Vineyard\, 1489 Grandview Rd\, Mount Joy\, PA\, 17552\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://grandviewwines.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/celebratemom.jpg
END:VEVENT
