SUMMARY:Bridgerton Trivia at grandview
DESCRIPTION:Join us for trivia the 1st Thursday of each month! We’ve made Trivia at Grandview even easier with no reservation required.  Seating is first come first serve.  Bring your friends for a fun night of local wine\, beer\, spirits\, light food and TRIVIA!  Groups of 6 or more people may be asked to split into 2 teams.  You are welcome to bring your own food or view our menu HERE.
URL:https://grandviewwines.com/vineyard-event/bridgerton-trivia-at-grandview/
LOCATION:Grandview Vineyard\, 1489 Grandview Rd\, Mount Joy\, PA\, 17552\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://grandviewwines.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Grandview_Bridgerton_May14.jpg
END:VEVENT
