SUMMARY:Dinner in the Vineyard at grandview
DESCRIPTION:TICKETS are NOW AVAILABLE!\nWe are excited to host our Dinner in the Vineyard again this year! We will be partnering with Rettew’s Catering to pair Grandview wines with incredible food. And the best part? You get to enjoy this intimate wine pairing dinner amidst our grapevines during sunset! This has become a yearly sell out event\, so be sure to secure your tickets as soon as they are available!\nPlease arrive at our lower driveway (sign indicates “Weddings & Events at Grandview”) and proceed to the grass parking on the right. Check-in 6-6:15 pm. We will begin the evening with a stroll to our table in the vineyard.\n\nTickets for this 4 course wine pairing dinner are $99 (plus tax).\n\nClick Here to Purchase Tickets
URL:https://grandviewwines.com/vineyard-event/dinner-in-the-vineyard-at-grandview-2/
LOCATION:Grandview Vineyard\, 1489 Grandview Rd\, Mount Joy\, PA\, 17552\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://grandviewwines.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/dinnerinthevineyard.jpg
END:VEVENT
